    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow V_{2}(s)=V_{2}\\frac{I_{2}(s)-\\frac{1}{S}(I_{2})I_{1}(s)}{(1)}$ 求系统函数 $H(s)=\\frac{V_{2}(s)}{V_{1}(s)};$",
        "bbox": [
