    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {V _ {2} (s)} & {= u a - u b} \\\\ & {= [ \\frac {S C _ {2}}{S C _ {2} + \\frac {1}{r _ {1}}} - \\frac {\\frac {1}{r _ {2}}}{S C _ {1} + \\frac {1}{r _ {2}}} ] V _ {1} (s)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            633,
