            949,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\therefore H (s) = \\frac {V _ {2} (s)}{V _ {1} (s)}} & {= \\frac {V _ {2}}{V _ {2} + \\frac {1}{S C _ {1}}} - \\frac {\\frac {1}{S C _ {2}}}{\\frac {1}{S C _ {2}} + V _ {1}}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {s ^ {2} - \\frac {1}{C C _ {2} r _ {1} V _ {2}}}{(s + \\frac {1}{C _ {2} r _ {1}}) (s + \\frac {1}{C _ {1} V _ {2}})}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            14,
            479,
            318,
            584
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {H (s) = \\frac {v _ {2} (s)}{v _ {1} (s)}} & {= \\frac {S C _ {2}}{S C _ {2} + \\frac {1}{n}} - \\frac {\\frac {1}{r _ {2}}}{S C _ {1} + \\frac {1}{r _ {2}}}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {S ^ {2} - \\frac {1}{C _ {1} C _ {2} r _ {1} r _ {2}}}{(S + C _ {2} r _ {1}) (S + \\frac {1}{C _ {1} r _ {2}})}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            609,
