    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 讨论 $k$ 值及系统稳定性",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            441,
            398,
            461
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 当 $k = 3$ ， $u_{1}(t) = \\cos 2tu(t)$ ，求响应 $u_{3}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            470,
            576,
            492
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $= \\widehat{P}\\overline{1}{S}^{2} + \\left( {3 + k}\\right) S + 1$ 中",
        "bbox": [
            45,
            526,
            343,
            569
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $3k > 0$ ，即 $k < 3$ 时，亲民不稳定， $k = 3$ 时，亲民临界稳定； $k > 3$ 时，亲民不稳定",
        "bbox": [
            53,
            569,
            457,
            665
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore u _ {3} | t | = (\\cos t - \\cos 2 t) u _ {1} | t |\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            130,
            917,
            426,
            956
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {u _ {3} (s) = \\frac {3}{s ^ {2} + 1}} & {\\cdot \\frac {s}{s ^ {2} + 4}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {a s + b}{s ^ {2} + 1} + \\frac {c s + d}{s ^ {2} + 4}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {s}{s ^ {2} + 1} + \\frac {- s}{s ^ {2} + 4}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            133,
            746,
            416,
            914
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) k=3时 $H(S)=\\frac{3}{S^{2}+1}$",
        "bbox": [
            47,
            689,
            357,
            744
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $\\left(1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{s}}+s\\right)u_{a}=u_{1}(s)+\\frac{k(u_{2}(s))}{\\frac{1}{s}}$ ①",
        "bbox": [
            584,
            397,
            991,
            453
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "增列关系： $u_{2}(s)=\\frac{\\frac{1}{s}}{1+\\frac{1}{s}}u_{a}=\\frac{1}{s+1}u_{a}\\textcircled{②}$",
        "bbox": [
            622,
            447,
            1000,
            509
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (s) = \\frac {V _ {3} (s)}{V _ {1} (s)} = \\frac {k U _ {2} (s)}{V _ {1} (s)} = \\frac {k}{S ^ {2} + (3 - k) S + 1}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            596,
            594,
            910,
