    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nY _ {1} (s) = \\frac {R _ {1}}{R _ {1} + \\frac {1}{s c}} \\cdot X (s) \\Rightarrow H _ {1} (s) = \\frac {Y _ {1} (s)}{X (s)} = \\frac {R _ {1}}{R _ {1} + \\frac {1}{s c}} = \\frac {R _ {1} c s}{R _ {1} c s + 1} = \\frac {s}{s + \\frac {1}{R _ {1} c}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            245,
