            960,
            510
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nY _ {2} (s) = \\frac {R _ {2}}{R _ {2} + s L} \\cdot X (s) \\Rightarrow H _ {2} (s) = \\frac {R _ {2} (s)}{X (s)} = \\frac {R _ {2}}{R _ {2} + s L} = \\frac {\\frac {R _ {2}}{L}}{S + \\frac {R _ {2}}{L}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
