        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由 ${H}_{1}\\left( S\\right)$ 和 ${H}_{2}\\left( S\\right)$ 可见,极点 $- \\frac{1}{{R}_{1}C}$ 和 $- \\frac{{R}_{2}}{L}$ 均在 $S$ 处半而",
        "bbox": [
            238,
            576,
            872,
            633
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $H_{1}(S)$ 和 $H_{2}(S)$ 均为可果成立反应(2) $R_{1}=1\\Omega$ , C=0.5F. 则 $H_{1}(S)=\\frac{S}{S+2}\\Rightarrow H_{1}(W)=\\frac{jw}{jw+2}$ 当 $x(t)=\\cos2t$ 时 $H_{1}(2)=\\frac{j^{2}}{j^{2}+2}=\\frac{j}{j+1}$ $|H_{1}(2)|=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+1}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ $\\varphi_{1}(2)=\\arctan\\frac{1}{0}-\\arctan\\frac{1}{1}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ $\\therefore y_{1}(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos(2t+\\frac{\\pi}{4})$",
